            "review_title": "Review at Le Jardin Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ewa K\nMelbourne, Australia43 contributions\n0\nGreat little hotel\nJul 2026 • Couples\nVery well located hotel , walking distance in the Old Town to most interests, then you can always get Grab or rickshaw. Clean, with great staff and huge , very comfortable bed ! breakfast full of great selections cold and warm. \nThe swimming pool comes in very handy on those hot steamy days and the of sky bar is pretty good although on our days the staff was a little bit slow. \nWould like to give a mention to Tracy from reception and the whole breakfast team each day of our 3 night stay 👌🏻\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 13, 2026",
