            "review_text": "tony12cu\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia2987 contributions\n0\nBuffet Breakfast catering to Koreans\nSep 2016 • Business\nNestled in Grand Plaza Hotel Hanoi, it provides buffet breakfast to the hotel guests.\n\nThe restaurant is very big with a wide spread of buffet, though heavily skewed towards catering for Koreans.\n\nThe decor is modern and the wait staff friendly and efficiency.\n\nThe ventilation needs a little work to prevent the grease spreading to the diners.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 2, 2016",
